  "reason": "Select only model_design because WEIGHT_DECAY is an allowed model configuration constant consumed by the frozen host. Approximately 1.12 million item-embedding parameters versus 131,548 training interactions motivate testing modest regularization; validation HR@10 of 0.645 at epoch 10 of 30 suggests a possible generalization limitation but does not establish overfitting. Historical successes support preserving the current gated branches and learned residual scales, while failed positional and depth-aggregation experiments favor isolating weight decay rather than adding architectural changes.",
